        <h2>Reading galaxies’ chemical fingerprints</h2>

        <p>
          Galaxies across cosmic time encode their chemistry, gas density,
          velocity, and energetic activity in their emission-line spectra.
          My research asks how reliably we can read those signals.
        </p>
