              <h3>Compact stellar systems in the Coma Cluster</h3>

              <p>
                With Professor Kristin Chiboucas’s group, I analyze JWST images
                of compact dwarf galaxies and ultra-compact dwarfs in the Coma
                Cluster. I use two-dimensional light-profile modeling to
                investigate their sizes and structures.
              </p>

              <div class="project-details">
